            "review_title": "Review at Banh Khot Goc Vu Sua",
            "review_text": "Ryan Hubris #1 in Vietnam\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1144 contributions\n0\nBest \"bánh khọt\" (fried shrimp dumpling)\nOct 2020 • Friends\nThey are the best \"bánh khọt\" in Vung Tau. This is a MUST visit food destination. The banh khot is freshly made in front of you by a legion of women dedicated to delivering the tastiest goodies. \n\nThe banh khot is served with shredded fresh papaya and carrots with fresh herbs and salads. \n\nDipped it in a blended sweeten fish sauce and you're in heaven. Enjoy!\nRead more\nWritten October 26, 2020",
