            "review_title": "Review at Banh Khot Goc Vu Sua",
            "review_text": "tumbleweeds023\nHanoi, Vietnam580 contributions\n0\nGreat discovery!\nMar 2019 • Couples\nOur first time eating banh khot and this seemed like a good place to try it - and it was! This are like a miniature version of banh xeo - crispy little rice crepes with shrimp or squid and seasonings, which you wrap in lettuce or mustard leaves and dip in sauce. Service was friendly and fast and the food was just delicious. This was one of the best meals we had during our four days in Vung Tau and I have the sense that this particular restaurant has been around for decades. Check it out!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 23, 2019",
