            "review_text": "Kiwisflythecoop\nTe Anau, New Zealand791 contributions\n0\nGood tastes\nDec 2018 • Couples\nWe stopped here 2 years ago and a great local meal, Bahn Knot. We came back this month and they still cook in the original place but serve you across the road. We arrived about 12.45 and it was quite busy but fitted us in with the locals. The food was still nice and can provide cold drinks if required, we were able to have a couple of beers. Nice local choice.\nRead more\nWritten December 12, 2018",
