            "review_text": "TjiangYao\nMataram, Indonesia19 contributions\n0\nbest banh kot\nNov 2018 • Friends\nthis is the place if you want to know how it feels like the locals. We were quite lucky we got seated when we arrived without queuing. Menus are in Vietnamese but the serving lady was very nice and helpful. Banh kot came in 5 minutes and they're hot, crispy and tasty, we even added for second portion. You can ask more veggies if you run out of them. Try their sugarcane with lemon juice, it's very refreshing and yummy. Overall nice place and yummy.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 12, 2018",
