            "review_title": "Review at Banh Khot Goc Vu Sua",
            "review_text": "Quang Kiet Le\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1198 contributions\n0\nBad service, dried and cold dishes\nMar 2018 • Business\nThe restaurant looked quite famous with hundreds of Vietnamese tourists waiting for a table. Its service, however, was really bad. We could not decide where we would like to sit. After seated, we were told to wait in \"few minutes\" but guess how long we needed to wait? 23 minutes with only fish sauce and vegetable were available. And then, 2 dishes of banh khot were served and we hardly finished them as they were cold, oily and tasteless.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 29, 2018",
